OL,3,AIkea cuts prices in bid to woo
OL,4,Acash-strapped customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwedish furniture giant Ikea is cutting
OL,7,Fprices across a range of popular
OL,8,Fproducts in Europe, including the Billy
OL,9,Fbookcase and Kallax storage units, to
OL,10,Fwoo cash-strapped customers.
OL,12,FIkea has seen revenue decline over the
OL,13,Fpast two years as the rising cost of
OL,14,Fliving reduces people's ability to
OL,15,Finvest in new furniture and home
OL,16,Frenovations.
OL,18,FThe company is spending bB,1.2bn (#1bn)
OL,19,Fon the price cuts, which represent
OL,20,Freductions of up to 28% on certain
OL,21,Fproducts.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
